+## Authorization and audit
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request. Viewers can use GET
+routes except `GET /audit`. Cooks can also cook recipes, record batch waste,
+log temperatures and enter stock-take counts. Managers can use every route,
+including `GET /audit`, which returns successful changes newest first. Each
+entry contains `time`, `keyName`, `method`, `path` (without a query string),
+and response `status`. Missing or unknown keys return `unauthorized` (401);
+known keys without permission return `forbidden` (403).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
