+## API keys and audit
+
+Schema 3 adds `apiKeys` (key, name, role) and `audit` arrays. Migration
+from schema 2 preserves existing data and starts missing arrays empty; an
+operator must configure keys for existing installations. Successful API writes
+append an audit entry with an ISO instant, key name, method, path and status.
